OL,3,AAI boom helps drive surprise UK growth
OL,4,Ain July
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's economy grew faster than
OL,7,Fexpected in July partly helped by
OL,8,Fbusinesses using artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI).
OL,11,FThe economy expanded by 0.4%, the
OL,12,FOffice for National Statistics (ONS)
OL,13,Fsaid, whereas analysts had predicted no
OL,14,Fgrowth.
OL,16,FGrowth in July was helped by a strong
OL,17,Fperformance from the services sector,
OL,18,Fand particularly computer programming.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
