OL,3,AAI boom helps drive surprise UK growth
OL,4,Ain July
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts said the figure showed the UK
OL,7,Feconomy was proving resilient in the
OL,8,Fface of shocks such as the war in Iran,
OL,9,Fbut they expect growth to slow in the
OL,10,Fmonths ahead as high energy prices
OL,11,Faffect households.
